  "notes": "USAGE:\n{離脱|りだつ} is a formal word used for deliberate or significant departures — leaving a political party, withdrawing from a treaty, or a player dropping out due to injury. It is more formal and definitive than simply {辞|や}める.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{離脱|りだつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to withdraw from ~)\n- ～⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{離脱|りだつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to leave ~ — less common)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {党|とう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{離脱|りだつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to leave a political party)\n- ⟦{条約|じょうやく}→条約：04912_jouyaku⟧⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧{離脱|りだつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to withdraw from a treaty)\n- ⟦{負傷|ふしょう}→負傷：15287_fushou⟧{離脱|りだつ} (withdrawal due to injury)\n- ⟦{戦線|せんせん}→戦線：22999_sensen⟧{離脱|りだつ} (leaving the front line; dropping out)\n- {離脱|りだつ}⟦{症状|しょうじょう}→症状：03234_shoujou⟧ (withdrawal symptoms)",
